+ * (rundll32 printui.dll,PrintUIEntry /o /n "printer"), as Windows has it:
+ * the documents waiting to print with their status, owner, pages, size,
+ * submitted time and port; Printer and Document menus to pause, resume,
+ * restart and cancel documents, pause the printer and cancel them all; the
+ * printer's preferences and properties. The list follows the queue.
